# macOS
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Editor / OS noise
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Athlete data: NEVER commit ---
# Deny-by-default, mirroring the repo-root .gitignore. Everything here is an
# athlete folder (personal-profile.md, plans/, programs/, logs/) except the
# shared parts named back in below, which hold no personal data. Ignoring the
# lot means a file nobody anticipated — an export saved one level too high, a
# scratch note, an archive/ directory — is covered without editing this file.
#
# No trailing slash on `/*`: it must match stray FILES here too, not just
# directories.
#
# Do NOT swap this for a list of filenames to exclude. Listing what to hide
# means anything unlisted is published by default.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/skills/
!/sources/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Transient build output
~$*.xlsx

# Packaged skill bundles are build artefacts — skills/ is canonical.
# See skills/README.md for how to rebuild one.
*.skill
